                <pb facs="0391" n="283" xml:id="pg283"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/8621: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-04-07T13:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 7, 1927—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 8—9:25
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>370. Yangtze Patrol commander telegraphed April 7 as follows: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Situation Hankow steadily growing worse. Japan[ese] evacuation continues
                            large number. One hundred Germans have requested cost of charter <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Chi Hum</hi> for evacuation purposes. Japanese
                            civilian shot in head by Chinese soldiers outside Japanese Concession
                            took refuge 2 a.m. in <hi rendition="#italic">Pigeon</hi>. Fights
                            between groups coolies ashore more frequent. Russians beginning to
                            evacuate. Lawlessness increasing with no apparent effort on part
                            Government to check. Am bringing all pressure to bear on Americans to
                            have their evacuation and those who remain to base upon steamer <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Para</hi>. Additional Japanese light cruisers
                            arrived today.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
